    {
      "id": "scene-05",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "The Correct Final Step",
        "bullets": [
          "You just calculated 1/Rp, not Rp!",
          "You must take the reciprocal (flip the fraction) to find Rp.",
          "In this simple case, the reciprocal of 1 is still 1, but if 1/Rp = 2/3, then Rp = 3/2 or 1.5 ohms.",
          "Always remember to flip your final answer."
        ]
      },
